{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\Books\\7th\\7th MAths\\JPG\\009.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "1.2.1Sigificantfigures", "conf": 0.858, "box": [[78, 10], [240, 2], [241, 21], [79, 30]]}, {"text": "Let's learn how to determine thenumber of significant figures in any number.", "conf": 0.899, "box": [[78, 35], [508, 16], [509, 36], [79, 56]]}, {"text": "All non-zero digits aresignificantfigures.Forexample,172.3has4significantfigures.", "conf": 0.9, "box": [[92, 53], [582, 32], [583, 52], [93, 73]]}, {"text": ":Zeros at thestart ofa numberareneversignificant.Forexample,0.0789 has3", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[92, 71], [542, 53], [543, 73], [93, 91]]}, {"text": "significantfigures.", "conf": 0.864, "box": [[105, 90], [208, 85], [209, 104], [106, 109]]}, {"text": ":Zeros that are within any two non-zerodigits and athe end ofa number afterthe", "conf": 0.892, "box": [[93, 107], [567, 89], [568, 109], [94, 127]]}, {"text": "decimalpoint are significant.Forexample,89.045 has 5 and 9.500 has 4 significant", "conf": 0.859, "box": [[105, 126], [569, 109], [569, 128], [106, 145]]}, {"text": "figures.", "conf": 0.876, "box": [[107, 146], [149, 146], [149, 161], [107, 161]]}, {"text": "Rules to round to the specified numberof significant figures", "conf": 0.901, "box": [[75, 163], [495, 150], [496, 169], [76, 183]]}, {"text": "Whenroundingtothespecifiednumberofsignificantdigits,roundsdown if thenextdigit", "conf": 0.94, "box": [[75, 183], [580, 167], [581, 186], [76, 202]]}, {"text": "is less than 5 and round up when the next digit is greater than or equal to 5.", "conf": 0.909, "box": [[73, 202], [500, 190], [501, 209], [74, 221]]}, {"text": "Example 1:", "conf": 0.801, "box": [[76, 224], [143, 224], [143, 242], [76, 242]]}, {"text": "Round 153,268 to four significantfigures.", "conf": 0.917, "box": [[73, 243], [325, 237], [326, 256], [74, 262]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.864, "box": [[74, 264], [133, 264], [133, 280], [74, 280]]}, {"text": "Here we consider1532.Thedigit next to 2 is 6 which is greater than 5. So, we will round up.", "conf": 0.887, "box": [[74, 282], [587, 268], [588, 288], [75, 301]]}, {"text": "Keep 1532 as it is and add 1 to the digit 2 and replace next digits by 0.", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[74, 301], [469, 290], [470, 309], [75, 320]]}, {"text": "So, 153268 rounded to 4 significant figures is 153,300.", "conf": 0.895, "box": [[73, 320], [378, 312], [378, 331], [74, 339]]}, {"text": "Example 2:", "conf": 0.819, "box": [[73, 341], [143, 338], [144, 355], [74, 358]]}, {"text": "Round 67.282 to three significant figures.", "conf": 0.886, "box": [[72, 357], [330, 352], [331, 371], [72, 377]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.856, "box": [[74, 378], [132, 378], [132, 396], [74, 396]]}, {"text": "Here we consider67.2.The next digit to2 is8 which is greater than5.So, wewill round up", "conf": 0.874, "box": [[72, 397], [579, 384], [579, 403], [72, 416]]}, {"text": "and add 1 to the digit2. So, 67.282 rounded to 3 significantfigures is 67.3", "conf": 0.897, "box": [[71, 415], [489, 406], [489, 425], [71, 434]]}, {"text": "1.2.2Estimation", "conf": 0.898, "box": [[71, 440], [185, 437], [185, 457], [71, 460]]}, {"text": "Example1:Findthevalueofthefollowing.Thenestimatetocheck iftheanswerisreasonable.", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[68, 466], [602, 453], [603, 473], [68, 485]]}, {"text": "Thecapacity ofan oil tank is 8259 litres and the capacity of anothertank is 4820 litres.", "conf": 0.898, "box": [[71, 488], [553, 478], [553, 497], [71, 507]]}, {"text": "Estimatethetotal capacity ofboth oil tanks andthen verify the answer.", "conf": 0.889, "box": [[70, 511], [468, 503], [468, 521], [71, 529]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.895, "box": [[70, 531], [129, 529], [130, 547], [71, 549]]}, {"text": "Let's add these: 8259 + 4820 = 13,079", "conf": 0.902, "box": [[69, 556], [284, 551], [285, 571], [70, 575]]}, {"text": "Let's estimate to check if theanswer is reasonable.", "conf": 0.87, "box": [[70, 578], [351, 574], [351, 591], [70, 596]]}, {"text": "Roundoff8259tothenearestthousand:82598000", "conf": 0.931, "box": [[69, 600], [367, 595], [368, 613], [70, 618]]}, {"text": "Roundoff4820tothenearestthousand:48205000", "conf": 0.951, "box": [[69, 623], [368, 618], [368, 635], [69, 639]]}, {"text": "Add:8259+48208000+5000=13,000", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[69, 648], [305, 646], [305, 663], [69, 666]]}, {"text": "Thecalculated answer13,079 is close to theestimated answeris13,000.", "conf": 0.893, "box": [[68, 677], [468, 673], [468, 692], [68, 696]]}, {"text": "So,ouranswer13,079 isreasonable", "conf": 0.869, "box": [[69, 703], [269, 701], [269, 719], [69, 720]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.893, "box": [[493, 751], [596, 743], [597, 763], [495, 770]]}]}